        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Karma Jump 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The journey of redemption continues.</strong><br>After the mysterious trials of <i>Karma Jump 1</i>, Bobby returns—haunted by his past sins and trapped in a surreal world where every leap tests his soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Karma Jump 2</strong>, challenge your mind and reflexes through an unforgettable blend of <strong>puzzle-solving, precision platforming, and emotional storytelling</strong>. Inspired by <i>Only Up</i>, <i>Only Down</i>, <i>Tomb Raider</i>, <i>Limbo</i>, <i>Little Nightmares</i>, and <i>Astro Bot</i>, this sequel pushes the limits of both your skill and your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Puzzles. Deeper Mind Games.</strong><br>Every stage is a test of logic and patience. Hidden mechanisms, shifting platforms, and deceptive illusions will challenge how you think—and how you feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Sin and Redemption</strong><br>Guide Bobby through breathtaking yet treacherous landscapes, where every mistake carries a price and every success brings him closer to forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning surreal worlds filled with mystery and danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles and brain teasers that evolve as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack that echoes Bobby’s emotional journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging yet rewarding platforming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark narrative exploring guilt, hope, and second chances</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Bobby finally find redemption—or fall deeper into the abyss of his own karma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices, your jumps, your fate. Welcome to Karma Jump 2.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Karma Jump 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The journey of redemption continues.</strong><br>After the mysterious trials of <i>Karma Jump 1</i>, Bobby returns—haunted by his past sins and trapped in a surreal world where every leap tests his soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Karma Jump 2</strong>, challenge your mind and reflexes through an unforgettable blend of <strong>puzzle-solving, precision platforming, and emotional storytelling</strong>. Inspired by <i>Only Up</i>, <i>Only Down</i>, <i>Tomb Raider</i>, <i>Limbo</i>, <i>Little Nightmares</i>, and <i>Astro Bot</i>, this sequel pushes the limits of both your skill and your spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Puzzles. Deeper Mind Games.</strong><br>Every stage is a test of logic and patience. Hidden mechanisms, shifting platforms, and deceptive illusions will challenge how you think—and how you feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Sin and Redemption</strong><br>Guide Bobby through breathtaking yet treacherous landscapes, where every mistake carries a price and every success brings him closer to forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning surreal worlds filled with mystery and danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles and brain teasers that evolve as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack that echoes Bobby’s emotional journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging yet rewarding platforming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark narrative exploring guilt, hope, and second chances</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Bobby finally find redemption—or fall deeper into the abyss of his own karma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices, your jumps, your fate. Welcome to Karma Jump 2.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Embark on Bobby’s journey of redemption in Karma Jump 2 — a mind-bending mix of puzzles, precision jumps, and emotional storytelling. Inspired by Only Up, Limbo, and Little Nightmares, every leap tests your skill, logic, and soul.",
